  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A ray of light enters from air into a water droplet of radius <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"r\"></span> at point S. S is a vertical distance <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"h\"></span> from the centre of the droplet. The droplet has a refractive index <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"n\"></span> and the angle of refraction is θ.</p>\n<p>What is sin θ?</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{nh}{r}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{r}{nh}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{h}{nr}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{nr}{h}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
